Accept, store and broadcast which subscription account a native agent uses.

external_session_usage accepts data.subscription (an account ID from Settings ->
Subscriptions), stores it in the omnigent.subscription session label for page
loads, and adds it to the session.usage SSE event. Like fast_mode, a post carrying only the subscription
skips the cost roll-up. Pairs with the runner patch
0010-subscription-in-use.patch and the web patch
0018-composer-subscription.patch. Applies after 0013-subscriptions.patch.
Base: omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f).

